      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roe%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Roe sits on the northern edge of the Grand Prairie, a flat, fertile plain that was among Arkansas’s last settled areas.",
